# Resolved against nightly, which the pinned stable path never uses, so this
# lockfile would record a toolchain CI does not run and drift with every
# nightly. The reproducible lockfile is `../Cargo.lock`, and `fuzz/` is
# excluded from that workspace.
Cargo.lock
